# Ask before guessing a reference

When a request could match more than one thing in the project, ask which one they mean before editing.

This includes UI parts, pages, components, copy, images, and data that share a name or sit near each other.

- Name the candidates in plain language.
- Wait for the answer.
- Do not pick the closest match and change it.

Example: "thumbnails" could mean the product photo strip or the yarn color swatches. Ask which one, then change only that.
